    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Donal Boyd Auctioneers are delighted to present 10 Corr na Meala to the market. In excellent condition throughout, this 4-bedroom semi-detached property would suit those seeking a large modern residence in the heart of Birr. The property is deceptively larger than it appears from the outside, extending to c.1560sq.ft, with features including double glazing, oil fired central heating and a beautiful front aspect overlooking a mature green area.\nLocated minutes from Birr town centre, the property will appeal to first time buyers, investors and those looking to downsize to be nearer amenities and services. \nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all this fantastic dwelling has to offer. \n\n**AWAITING BER CERT**\n\n\nFEATURES\n*OIL FIRED CENTRAL HEATING\n*DOUBLE GLAZING THROUGHOUT\n*MINUTES WALK FROM BIRR TOWN CENTRE\n*EXCELLENT CONDITION THROUGHOUT\n*ACCOMMODATION EXTENDS TO c.1560 sq.ft\n\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nENTRANCE HALL \n(2m x 6.2m)\nBright and spacious with feature side window to allow for extra light. Tiled flooring and door to rear garden also.\n\nLOUNGE \n(4.8m x 5.45m\nWell appointed with open fireplace in cast iron surround, wooden mantel and granite plinth. Wooded flooring and double doors to kitchen/diner. Fantastic bay window overlooking the green area to the front of the property.\n\n\nKITCHEN /DINING ROOM \n(4.8m x 5.5m) \nExtremely spacious with an excellent range of modern built in kitchen units, stainless steel sink unit in tiled splashback, tiled floor and sliding door to rear garden.\n\nUTILITY \n(1.76m x 2m)\nPlumbed for washer and dryer. Tiled floor.\n\nGUEST WC \n(1.58m x 2m) \nWith WC, WHB and tiled floor.\n\nUPSTAIRS\n\nLANDING\n(1.7m x 2.1m) plus (1.36m x 4)\nWith large Hot Press and access to attic.\n\nBEDROOM 1\n(4m x 6.06m) \nWith excellent range of built in wardrobes with feature mirrored doors and built in chest of drawers. Superb views overlooking the mature green area to the front. \n\nENSUITE\nWith WC, WHB, shaver light and tiled shower cubicle with Triton T90z electric shower. Tiled floor also.\n\nBEDROOM 2 \n(3.39m x 3.85m) \nWith built in wardrobes with feature mirrored door and chest of drawers.\n\nBEDROOM 3\n(2.88m x 3.38m)\nOverlooking the rear garden.\n\nBEDROOM 4\n(2.75m x 3.05m)\nWith built in wardrobes\n\nMAIN BATHROOM \n(2.6m x 2.65m)\nLarge and spacious with WC, WHB, bath in tiled surround and tiled shower cubicle with Hydramax power shower. Tiled floor also.\n\nOUTSIDE: \nSet well back from the road there is a parking apron for a number of vehicles to the front of the property together with a lawned area. A side garden leads to the rear garden which is in lawn and fenced all round. Garden shed also.\n\nVIEWING IS BY APPOINTMENT ONLY WITH THE SOLE SELLING AGENTS, DONAL BOYD AUCTIONEERS. FOR MORE INFOROMATION PLEASE CALL DONAL BOYD ON 0872554412 OR EMAIL THE ADDRESS BELOW\n\nDONAL BOYD AUCTIONEERS LTD\nPSR LICENCE NO 001591\n"
      },
